From: cobods-tech <noreply@github.com>
Subject: Include Cromite Android string fragments in the GRIT catalog

The Cromite settings and first-run patches add GRDP fragments, but the
Chromium Android strings GRD must explicitly include them for GRIT to
generate their Android resources. Keep both fragments in the existing
Android Chrome catalog so their strings can later receive zh-CN XTB
translations without creating a new translation catalog.

---
diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/android/strings/android_chrome_strings.grd b/chrome/browser/ui/android/strings/android_chrome_strings.grd
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/android/strings/android_chrome_strings.grd
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/android/strings/android_chrome_strings.grd
@@ -4805,1 +4805,3 @@
-</messages>
+  <part file="cromite_android_chrome_strings_grd/Cromite-settings-ui.grdp" />
+  <part file="cromite_android_chrome_strings_grd/Welcome-screen.grdp" />
+</messages>
